    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Integration correction: Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101's free-roam camp-kit enforcement was needlessly calling `INVENTORY_ENABLE_ITEM` on both camp-kit hashes every 500 ms after the kits were already absent. That repeated shared-inventory mutation is now removed. Free roam is read-only unless a kit actually reappears and must be banked; only a genuinely banked kit is enabled/restored on mission entry.\n\nThe Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101/#114/campsite checks pass. Build `79FB209BB9375C83D8104F2C7A56C087A725AB35712913524F1FA3E7E8F67A21` is queued for automatic verified installation after RDR2 exits, so Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101 is `actionable` until that happens.",
